<title>DENMARK: Novo Nordisk first quarter profit up.</title>
<headline>Novo Nordisk first quarter profit up.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31 1997</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net turnover		3,660   vs  3,433</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		560   vs    557</p>
<p> Group operating result	    552   vs    510</p>
<p> Group net result		    398   vs    396</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish biotech group is Novo Nordisk A/S. It said in a statement that its forecast of a 15 percent rise in 1997 full-year operating profits was unchanged.  </p>
<p>The first quarter result was above analysts' average expectations of 393 million crowns net profit.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom + 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
